1
00:00:00,452 --> 00:00:02,282
(Sheldon:)Well, anyone.

2
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:04,620
(Beverley:)Nor I.

3
00:00:05,165 --> 00:00:06,585
(Sheldon:)What are the odds...

4
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:09,290
(Sheldon:)...that two individuals
as unique as ourselves...

5
00:00:09,461 --> 00:00:14,171
(Sheldon:)...would be connected by someone
as comparatively workaday as your son?

6
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:19,470
(Beverley:)Is that a rhetorical point
or would you like to do the math?

7
00:00:20,764 --> 00:00:22,644
(Sheldon:)I'd like to do the math.

8
00:00:25,185 --> 00:00:27,015
(Beverley:)I'd like that too.

9
00:00:29,731 --> 00:00:31,691
[PENNY MOANS]

10
00:00:31,858 --> 00:00:33,188
BOTH:
Aah!

11
00:00:33,360 --> 00:00:34,400
[LEONARD GIGGLES]

12
00:00:34,569 --> 00:00:38,029
[PENNY MOANS THEN COUGHS]

13
00:00:38,531 --> 00:00:39,531
PENNY:
Mm.

14
00:00:39,699 --> 00:00:40,779
(Beverley:)- Oh.
- Heh-heh-heh.

15
00:00:40,951 --> 00:00:43,201
[BOTH LAUGHING]

16
00:00:43,411 --> 00:00:45,701
- Okay, now this time...
- Uh-huh.

17
00:00:45,872 --> 00:00:48,082
(Penny:)...you're gonna lick the salt...

18
00:00:48,667 --> 00:00:50,247
(Penny:)...off my neck...

19
00:00:53,129 --> 00:00:55,219
...do the shot... Whoops!

20
00:00:55,799 --> 00:00:58,389
(Penny:)...and then bite the lime.

21
00:00:58,551 --> 00:01:03,021
[CHUCKLING]

